Package: deadband
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Deadband contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtqml, python3-pyside6.qtquick, python3-hid, libusb-1.0-0, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-shapes
Description: Linux configuration app for GameSir controllers and Logitech mice
 Deadband configures supported GameSir controllers and Logitech gaming mice,
 including lighting, sticks, triggers, buttons, macros, and DPI profiles.
